[{"id":1214,"name":"Maiti2026Power.exists_isPAC_blockBallSet","kind":"Theorem","keyword":"theorem","module":"Maiti2026Power.MXJ2026.Separation","package":"Maiti2026Power","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"96d3ca9962ad0b06","local":"905463271d6fad3f","content":"76ff7bcc06f70172"},"doc":"**Theorem 7, adaptive upper bound**: for `k ≥ 1`, `ε ∈ (0, 1]` and `δ ∈ (0, 1)`, there is an\n(adaptive) `(ε, δ)`-PAC identification algorithm on the block-ball set of `ℝ^{kd}` with budget\n`T ≤ 2·10⁶ (kd log(8k/δ) + d²) / ε²`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":true,"head":"Nat","implicit":false,"name":"k","role":"variable","type":"ℕ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Nat","implicit":false,"name":"d","role":"variable","type":"ℕ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"LE.le","implicit":false,"name":"hk","role":"hypothesis","type":"1 ≤ k","typeRefs":[[2,3,"LE.le"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Real","implicit":true,"name":"ε","role":"variable","type":"ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Real","implicit":true,"name":"δ","role":"variable","type":"ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Membership.mem","implicit":false,"name":"hε","role":"hypothesis","type":"ε ∈ Set.Ioc 0 1","typeRefs":[[2,3,"Membership.mem"],[4,11,"Set.Ioc"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Membership.mem","implicit":false,"name":"hδ","role":"hypothesis","type":"δ ∈ Set.Ioo 0 1","typeRefs":[[2,3,"Membership.mem"],[4,11,"Set.Ioo"]]}],"conclusion":"∃ T,\n  ↑T ≤ 2000000 * (↑k * ↑d * Real.log (8 * ↑k / δ) + ↑d ^ 2) / ε ^ 2 ∧\n    ∃ A, A.IsFixedBudget T ∧ Learning.LinearBandit.IsPAC (blockBallSet k d) A ε δ","conclusionHead":"Exists","conclusionRefs":[[10,11,"LE.le"],[20,21,"HMul.hMul"],[26,27,"HMul.hMul"],[31,32,"HMul.hMul"],[33,41,"Real.log"],[45,46,"HMul.hMul"],[50,51,"HDiv.hDiv"],[55,56,"HAdd.hAdd"],[60,61,"HPow.hPow"],[65,66,"HDiv.hDiv"],[69,70,"HPow.hPow"],[73,74,"And"],[86,99,"Learning.IdentAlg.IsFixedBudget"],[102,103,"And"],[104,131,"Learning.LinearBandit.IsPAC"],[133,145,"Maiti2026Power.blockBallSet"]],"decl":"Maiti2026Power.exists_isPAC_blockBallSet"},"code":"/-- **Theorem 7, adaptive upper bound**: for `k ≥ 1`, `ε ∈ (0, 1]` and `δ ∈ (0, 1)`, there is an\n(adaptive) `(ε, δ)`-PAC identification algorithm on the block-ball set of `ℝ^{kd}` with budget\n`T ≤ 2·10⁶ (kd log(8k/δ) + d²) / ε²`. -/\ntheorem exists_isPAC_blockBallSet (k d : ℕ) (hk : 1 ≤ k) {ε δ : ℝ} (hε : ε ∈ Set.Ioc 0 1)\n    (hδ : δ ∈ Set.Ioo 0 1) :\n    ∃ T : ℕ, (T : ℝ) ≤ 2000000 * (k * d * log (8 * k / δ) + (d : ℝ) ^ 2) / ε ^ 2 ∧\n      ∃ A : IdentAlg Unit (blockBallSet k d) ℝ (blockBallSet k d), A.IsFixedBudget T ∧\n        IsPAC (blockBallSet k d) A ε δ","proof":":= by\n  classical\n  have : Nonempty (blockBallSet k d) := (blockBallSet_nonempty ⟨0, hk⟩).to_subtype\n  let Q : BlockParam := ⟨k, hk, ε, δ, hε, hδ⟩\n  have hbad : ∀ θ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin k × Fin d),\n      MeasurableSet {x : blockBallSet k d | ε < simpleRegret (blockBallSet k d) θ x} := fun θ ↦\n    measurableSet_lt measurable_const (measurable_simpleRegret _ θ)\n  rcases Nat.eq_zero_or_pos d with rfl | hd\n  · -- degenerate case `d = 0`: every reward vector is `0` and every recommendation is optimal\n    refine ⟨0, by simp, IdentAlg.fixedBudget (Q.alg 0).toAlgorithm 0\n      (Kernel.deterministic (fun _ ↦ Q.zeroBB 0) measurable_const),\n      IdentAlg.isFixedBudget_fixedBudget _ _ _, ?_⟩\n    refine SeededAlg.linearBandit_isPAC_fixedBudget_deterministic (Q.alg 0) measurable_const hbad\n      fun θ ↦ ?_\n    have hθ : θ = 0 := by\n      ext p\n      exact isEmptyElim p\n    have hempty : {ω : ℕ → (Fin 0 → Bool) × ℝ |\n        ε < simpleRegret (blockBallSet k 0) θ (Q.zeroBB 0)} = ∅ :=\n      Set.eq_empty_of_forall_notMem fun ω hω ↦\n        absurd (show ε < simpleRegret (blockBallSet k 0) θ (Q.zeroBB 0) from hω)\n          (not_lt.2 (by simp [simpleRegret, hθ, hε.1.le]))\n    rw [hempty, measureReal_empty]\n    exact hδ.1.le\n  · refine ⟨Q.T d, Q.T_le hd, IdentAlg.fixedBudget (Q.alg d).toAlgorithm (Q.T d)\n      (Kernel.deterministic (Q.output d) Q.measurable_output),\n      IdentAlg.isFixedBudget_fixedBudget _ _ _, ?_⟩\n    exact SeededAlg.linearBandit_isPAC_fixedBudget_deterministic (Q.alg d) Q.measurable_output\n      hbad fun θ ↦ measureReal_lt_le_of_one_sub_le_measureReal_le\n        ((measurable_simpleRegret _ θ).comp (Q.measurable_output.comp\n          (SeededAlg.measurable_seedFinHist (by fun_prop) _)))\n        (Q.one_sub_le_seedMeasure_real_output hd θ)","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/MXJ2026/Separation.lean","start":153,"end":191,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/MXJ2026/Separation.lean#L153-L191"},"deps":[93,95,1222],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommMonoidWithOne.toAddMonoidWithOne","mathlib","instance"],["AddMonoidWithOne.toNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["And","lean4","structure"],["BorelSpace.opensMeasurable","mathlib","instance"],["DivInvMonoid.toDiv","mathlib","instance"],["ENNReal","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal.instAddCommMonoidWithOne","mathlib","instance"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["EuclideanSpace","mathlib","definition"],["Exists","lean4","inductive"],["Fin","lean4","structure"],["Fin.fintype","mathlib","instance"],["HAdd.hAdd","lean4","definition"],["HDiv.hDiv","lean4","definition"],["HMul.hMul","lean4","definition"],["HPow.hPow","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["Inner.inner","mathlib","definition"],["InnerProductSpace","mathlib","class"],["InnerProductSpace.toInner","mathlib","instance"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["LT.lt","lean4","definition"],["Learning.Environment","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Hist","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IdentAlg","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsPAC","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IdentAlg.stopSet","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.stationaryEnv","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasurableSpace.pi","mathlib","instance"],["Membership.mem","lean4","definition"],["Monoid.toNPow","mathlib","instance"],["NNReal","mathlib","definition"],["NNReal.instOne","mathlib","instance"],["NPow.toPow","mathlib","instance"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Nat.cast","lean4","definition"],["Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","mathlib","instance"],["Nat.instNeZeroSucc","lean4","instance"],["Ne","lean4","definition"],["Norm.norm","mathlib","definition"],["NormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","class"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["One.toOfNat1","lean4","instance"],["OpensMeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["PUnit.instMeasurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["PiLp.borelSpace","mathlib","instance"],["PiLp.innerProductSpace","mathlib","instance"],["PiLp.innerProductSpace._proof_1","mathlib","theorem"],["PiLp.instNorm","mathlib","instance"],["PiLp.normedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["ProbabilityTheory.Kernel","mathlib","structure"],["ProbabilityTheory.Kernel.mk","mathlib","constructor"],["ProbabilityTheory.gaussianReal","mathlib","definition"],["Prod","lean4","structure"],["Prod.mk","lean4","constructor"],["PseudoEMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toPseudoEMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["RCLike.toInnerProductSpaceReal","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.borelSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instAdd","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instDivInvMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLT","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMul","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instOne","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instRCLike","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSub","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSupSet","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instZero","mathlib","instance"],["Real.log","mathlib","definition"],["Real.measurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real.norm","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Set","mathlib","definition"],["Set.Elem","mathlib","definition"],["Set.Ioc","mathlib","definition"],["Set.Ioo","mathlib","definition"],["Set.instMembership","mathlib","instance"],["Set.ofPred","mathlib","definition"],["Sigma","lean4","structure"],["Sigma.fst","lean4","definition"],["Subtype.instMeasurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Subtype.val","lean4","definition"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Unit","lean4","definition"],["WithLp.measurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["WithLp.ofLp","mathlib","definition"],["Zero.toOfNat0","lean4","instance"],["fact_one_le_two_ennreal","mathlib","instance"],["iSup","mathlib","definition"],["instCountableFin","mathlib","instance"],["instCountableProd","mathlib","instance"],["instFintypeProd","mathlib","instance"],["instHAdd","lean4","instance"],["instHDiv","lean4","instance"],["instHMul","lean4","instance"],["instHPow","lean4","instance"],["instHSub","lean4","instance"],["instLENat","lean4","instance"],["instOfNatAtLeastTwo","mathlib","instance"],["instOfNatNat","lean4","instance"],["instSecondCountableTopologyReal","mathlib","instance"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":{"decl":"Maiti2026Power.exists_isPAC_blockBallSet","label":"Theorem 7 — polynomial separation: adaptive upper bound O((kd log(8k/δ) + d²)/ε²)","note":"With `blockBallSet_le_budget_of_isFixedDesign_of_isPAC` (non-adaptive lower bound Ω(kd²/ε²)) and `blockBallSet_le_budget_of_isPAC` (Ω(kd log(1/δ)/ε²)) in the same file. Non-adaptive means a deterministic fixed design with an arbitrary recommendation kernel. The two lower bounds are proved (no `sorry`): the adaptive one from Theorem 2 on the blo